    "Edge alignment needs structured scenes with depth discontinuities and image edges; textureless or very distant scenes yield an inconclusive result.",
    "the cloud has no per-point time: image and scan are paired at the header stamp; the recording is short but its view hardly changes (median view change 0.036), so scans stay 1 s apart: denser frames would repeat it"
